flowchart LR
  A[AUTHORIZE] -->|authRef + intentDigest| X[EXECUTE]
  X -->|executionRef| V[VERIFY]
  V -->|verificationRef| C[COMMIT]
  A -. hash chain .-> X
  X -. hash chain .-> V
  V -. hash chain .-> C
  A --> M[Merkle Tree]
  X --> M
  V --> M
  C --> M
  M --> CP[Signed Checkpoint]
  CP --> EXT[External witness/store]
